    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698750/extras/817224919a8ca2411e090e9ac658cdb3.avif?t=1655393173\" /></div><br><br>The game starts with Thomas after the cat follows his brothers kidnapped by a mysterious creature, entering a dark portal. Now Thomas faces a magical and different world, corrupted by dark magic. <br><br>Inspired by adventure and exploration games, the character must learn the magic of this world to survive the dark side of this universe. Explore these fantastical environments in search of Thomas' brothers, but beware of the obstacles and traps it has.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698750/extras/69d2fa6e8635478ec1bfd5704dc8de96.poster.avif?t=1655393173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698750/extras/69d2fa6e8635478ec1bfd5704dc8de96.webm?t=1655393173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698750/extras/69d2fa6e8635478ec1bfd5704dc8de96.mp4?t=1655393173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Combat enemies through the spells cast by the Magic Scepter.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698750/extras/8a015c6f641feaa3fd26638e51cea459.poster.avif?t=1655393173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698750/extras/8a015c6f641feaa3fd26638e51cea459.webm?t=1655393173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698750/extras/8a015c6f641feaa3fd26638e51cea459.mp4?t=1655393173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>While exploring Dungeons, 